      "text": "void take(int first, int second);\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct Single {\n    void reset() {\n        take(1, 2);\n        auto copy = T();\n    }\n};\n\ntemplate struct Single<char>;\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct Twice {\n    void reset() {\n        T value{};\n        auto copy = value;\n    }\n};\n\ntemplate struct Twice<char>;\ntemplate struct Twice<int>;\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nstruct Outside {\n    void reset();\n};\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nvoid Outside<T>::reset() {\n    auto copy = T();\n}\n\ntemplate struct Outside<char>;\n",
